@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "牙医" as A0
boundary "<u>:牙医接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:签署及补充病历</u>\n<u>控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:就诊</u>" as Visit
participant "<u>:病历</u>" as Record
participant "<u>:病历补充</u>" as Addendum
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-11办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-11办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Visit : 核对接诊责任(补充牙医)
activate Visit
Visit --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Visit
K -> Visit : 追加病历说明(已签署病历、正文和原因)
activate Visit
Visit -> Record : 核对原签署(原版本及签署依据)
activate Record
Record -> Addendum : 形成独立补充(正文、原因、人员时间)
activate Addendum
Addendum --> Record : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Addendum
Record --> Visit : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Record
Visit --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Visit
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Addendum
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
